# Test Coverage Matrix — MANDATORY

## Purpose

This rule ensures that **every feature** has coverage across **all mandatory test types**. It prevents the gap where specific test categories (API contract, i18n, accessibility, data entry permutations, etc.) are documented in strategy but never implemented.

## The Mandatory Test Type Registry

Every feature in the system MUST have tests across these categories. When creating or reviewing tests for any feature, verify ALL rows are covered.

### Tier 1 — Core Test Types (BLOCKING — must exist before PR merge)

| # | Test Type | Trait Value | Min Tests | File Pattern | Description |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| T1 | Positive | `[Trait("Category", "Positive")]` | 3+ per feature | `PositiveTests.cs` | Happy-path scenarios |
| T2 | Negative | `[Trait("Category", "Negative")]` | 3×P per feature | `NegativeTests.cs` | Invalid input, unauthorized, expected failures |
| T3 | Boundary | `[Trait("Category", "Boundary")]` | 3×P per feature | `BoundaryTests.cs` | Edge values, soft-delete interactions, type mismatches |
| T4 | Functional | `[Trait("Category", "Functional")]` | 3×P per feature | `FunctionalTests.cs` | Business rules, audit, permissions, workflow transitions |
| T5 | Integration | `[Trait("Category", "Integration")]` | 3×P per feature | `IntegrationTests.cs` | Full CRUD, service-to-DB, multi-component flows |

### Tier 2 — Extended Test Types (REQUIRED — must exist per feature)

| # | Test Type | Trait Value | Min Tests | File Pattern | Description |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| T6 | Unit | `[Trait("Category", "Unit")]` | 5+ per feature | `UnitTests.cs` | Validation, formatting, calculations, status logic |
| T7 | Concurrency | `[Trait("Category", "Concurrency")]` | 3+ per feature | `ConcurrencyTests.cs` | Race conditions, double-submit, transaction isolation |
| T8 | Performance | `[Trait("Category", "Performance")]` | 3+ per feature | `PerformanceTests.cs` | Response time, throughput, memory, N+1 detection |
| T9 | Load | `[Trait("Category", "Load")]` | 3+ per feature | `LoadTests.cs` | Sustained load, spike, stress, recovery |
| T10 | Data Entry Permutations | `[Trait("Category", "DataEntryPermutation")]` | 10+ per feature | `*PermutationTests.cs` | Field order, pairwise combos, mixed valid/invalid |

### Tier 3 — Cross-Cutting Test Types (REQUIRED — system-wide, not per-feature)

| # | Test Type | Trait Value | Min Tests | File Pattern | Description |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| T11 | Security | `[Trait("Category", "Security")]` | 20+ system-wide | `SecurityTests.cs` | Auth bypass, injection, CSRF, data exposure |
| T12 | API Contract | `[Trait("Category", "ApiContract")]` | 5+ per endpoint group | `ApiContractTests.cs` | Request/response schema validation, status codes, headers |
| T13 | Accessibility | `[Trait("Category", "Accessibility")]` | 10+ system-wide | `AccessibilityTests.cs` | WCAG compliance, keyboard nav, screen reader, axe-core |
| T14 | Internationalization | `[Trait("Category", "i18n")]` | 10+ system-wide | `I18nTests.cs` | Translation completeness, locale formatting, RTL |
| T15 | Error Recovery | `[Trait("Category", "ErrorRecovery")]` | 5+ per service | `ErrorRecoveryTests.cs` | Network failure, retry logic, timeout handling, graceful degradation |
| T16 | Rate Limiting | `[Trait("Category", "RateLimiting")]` | 5+ system-wide | `RateLimitingTests.cs` | Throttle enforcement, bypass prevention, header validation |

### Tier 4 — E2E Test Types (Playwright — separate from C#)

| # | Test Type | Location | Min Specs | File Pattern | Description |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| T17 | E2E Smoke | `QA Tests/Playwright Tests/` | 6 specs | `*.spec.ts` | Login, home, dashboard, partners, opportunities, interactions |
| T18 | E2E Feature | `QA Tests/Playwright Tests/` | 1+ per feature | `*.spec.ts` | Feature-specific browser workflows |
| T19 | E2E Cross-Browser | `QA Tests/Playwright Tests/` | Full suite × 3 | `*.spec.ts` | Chrome, Firefox, Safari/WebKit |
| T20 | E2E Accessibility | `QA Tests/Playwright Tests/` | 5+ specs | `accessibility*.spec.ts` | axe-core integration, keyboard nav, ARIA |

